{"lesson":{"title":"Other Wing. Same Read?","hook":"Two decisions. Watch how your reply and recovery shape the next ball.","livePoint":true,"branch":"lt1","nodes":{"lt1A":{"scene":"lt1A","ph":"Live Point","short":"Read","name":"When do you recover?","sit":"Your higher crosscourt reply is on its way.","q":"When do you recover?","opts":["Watch their direction, then recover","Recover now; split as they hit"],"correct":1,"lines":{"A":"You watched the shot. They hit while you were still wide.","B":"You used the flight time to move back towards coverage."},"noTargets":true,"rail":["Watch","Choose","See what changes"],"unlock":"Read the next situation","take":"Start recovering during your shot. Read their hit to adjust.","payoff":"Start recovering during your shot. Read their hit to adjust.","principle":"Your reply buys time. Your movement puts it to work.","why":"Move towards a position that covers their available angles while your ball travels. Time your split around their contact, then respond to what they actually hit. The higher reply gives you more time to do this.","continuation":true},"lt1B":{"scene":"lt1B","ph":"Live Point","short":"Read","name":"When do you recover?","sit":"Your flatter reply through the middle is on its way.","q":"When do you recover?","opts":["Watch their direction, then recover","Recover now; split as they hit"],"correct":1,"lines":{"A":"You watched the shot. They hit while you were still wide.","B":"You used the flight time to move back towards coverage."},"noTargets":true,"rail":["Watch","Choose","See what changes"],"unlock":"Read the next situation","take":"Start recovering during your shot. Read their hit to adjust.","payoff":"Start recovering during your shot. Read their hit to adjust.","principle":"Your reply buys time. Your movement puts it to work.","why":"Move towards a position that covers their available angles while your ball travels. Time your split around their contact, then respond to what they actually hit. This quicker reply l